r CLOSED + LOCKED; rejected if cover open — same for button or PLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;height:0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-left:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 7pt 5pt 7pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Run → R&amp;amp;D (DOWN)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-left:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 7pt 5pt 7pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Short press SAFETY RESET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-left:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#e7f2e7;padding:5pt 7pt 5pt 7pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1e6b1e;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-left:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 7pt 5pt 7pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Sheds energy (drops HV). System must confirm ZERO motor speed and ZERO current before HV is dropped. Applies equally to the PLC path.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;height:0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-left:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 7pt 5pt 7pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;D → Safe (DOWN)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-left:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 7pt 5pt 7pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Short press SAFETY RESET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-left:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#e7f2e7;padding:5pt 7pt 5pt 7pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1e6b1e;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-left:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 7pt 5pt 7pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Sheds energy (de-energises LV domain). Returns to de-energised Safe Mode.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;height:0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-left:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.5pt;vertical-align:middle;background-co